<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8435" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπι-στήμων</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπι-άμων</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Archyt.
			3
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ignorant,
				unskilful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.67
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆες ἀνεπιστήμονες</span>
			ships <i>with unskilful crews,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπειροι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.89
			</span></i>: so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲν ἀ. ἐᾶν</span> leave
			no part <i>untrained,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				795c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινός</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>
			<i>unskilled in</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				350b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				202c
			</span></i>: c. inf., <i>not knowing how</i> to do a
			thing, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.3.7
			</span></i>: foll. by relat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὅτι . .</span>
			<i>not knowing</i> that . ., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.111
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὅπῃ τράπωνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.112
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μόνως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					636e
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				3.11
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>without knowledge, unintelligent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				350b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ δ᾽ ἑτέρη [γνώμη] ἀνεπιστημονεστέρη
					μέν ἐστι τῆς ἑτέρης</span>”
				<i>less intelligent,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.21
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
